e, please do not inform HQ of my involvement."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You don't have to worry about M4 for now either. Persica is doing everything she can to solve the problem."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Before a solution can be found, I'll be taking her place in leading the AR Team to investigate Sangvis Ferri..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"eliza0","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"On another note, the Ringleader who invaded the detention center and caused this tragedy..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Has been confirmed to be none other than the highest being in command of Sangvis Ferri, a T-Doll designated \"Mastermind\"."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Surely you know what this means?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Please be prepared, Commander."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We're about the settle the score with S.F. for good..."}]}]}]}
